WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.600
The evening starts at the kerb.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.000
One photo reads the plate, make and colour.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.500
The ticket is on the guest's phone. Nothing to download.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.000
Request from the table.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.500
Pay and tip. By text.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.000
A text when it is at the door.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.300
Car and guest arrive together.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:50.000
Valett. A new era for a timeless service.
